shortdesc How to install AmiWeb2c
longdesc This is a guide for the installation of (La)TeX with the Amiga
longdesc port of Web2C named AmiWeb2C in the version 2.1 on an emulated
longdesc Amiga 4000 computer running Workbench 3.1. Furthermore the
longdesc installation of an ARexx server for calling LaTeX from an
longdesc editor is described and some tips for the installation of new
longdesc fonts are given.
